# The delivery lane's live claim store and its draw ledger. Never tracked, and ignored explicitly
# from 2026-09-02 because the seat executor now writes a copy into its WORKTREE (so the child's
# `--landed`/`--release`, which import the worktree's `delivery_lane`, reach a real claim). Without
# this the child finds an untracked file in `docs/observability/` every turn -- noise at best, and
# at worst a broad pathspec committing one lane's live claims into the shared tree.
docs/observability/.delivery_lane_claims.json
docs/observability/.delivery_lane_claims.draws.json
docs/reports/ledger_latest.json
docs/observability/*.log
