docs/observability/.worker_tick_health.json
docs/observability/worker-tick-log.md

# playwright/npm deps for pixel-verification harness (restored 2026-07-25)
node_modules/

# Runtime state for at-most-once NTFY execution (2026-07-29, DIRECTOR_RULING_FIX_DOUBLE_MESSAGING).
# The singleton lock is per-boot and the claim ledger is a local, self-pruning at-most-once
# record -- neither is behaviour-determining declaration, so neither belongs in the repo.
background/.ntfy_responder.lock
background/.ntfy_claimed_ids/

# The internal query store (atom G12_queryable_projections). Derived from committed truth and
# REBUILT by tools/build_projections.py on every run, so committing it would create exactly the
# second source of truth the atom exists to prevent -- a divergent copy that outlives its sources.
docs/observability/projections.sqlite
docs/observability/projections.sqlite.rebuilding
